Restaurant DBMS Project
Overview
This project is a Restaurant Database Management System (DBMS) developed using Microsoft SQL Server.
It demonstrates database creation, table design, data insertion, and SQL queries for managing restaurant-related information.
Technologies
Microsoft SQL Server
SQL
Relational Database Management System (RDBMS)
Main Modules
Restaurant management
Customer management
Food management
Staff management
Payment management
Database Operations
The SQL script includes examples of:
Database creation
Table creation
Primary keys
Foreign keys
Data insertion
Data retrieval using SELECT
Date handling
Relational database structure
How to Run
Open SQL Server Management Studio (SSMS).
Open PRABHAS_GitHub.sql.
Execute the complete script.
The script creates the restaurant database and its required tables/data.
Run SELECT queries to verify the inserted records.
Project File
PRABHAS_GitHub.sql — Complete SQL Server database script.
